{
    "title": "Everyday Puzzles: Mini Games",
    "description": "Everyday Puzzles - multiple games in one app!\r\n\r\n\r\nA minigames hub with word games and puzzles.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnygram, Hashtag, Crossword, Mini Crossword, Password, Tangle, Word Search, Cladder, Sudoku and Connected.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlay the newest minigame: SECRET WORD.\r\n\r\nPlay every day and keep your flame burning!\r\nThe FLAME represents your daily streak.\r\nTo light it, play Everyday Puzzles or unlimited mode.\r\nEvery day you play and maintain your streak, your flame increases one level of brightness.\r\n\r\n\r\nCONSTANTLY UPDATED!\r\n\r\nMANY GAMES IN ONE:\r\n\r\nANYGRAM\r\nUnleash your anagram skills. Connect the letters to form as many words as possible and fill the board. It's like a word hunt in anagram form! Discover the hidden words and show off your vocabulary skills!\r\n\r\n\r\nHASHTAG\r\nSwipe and spell your way to victory! Drag and drop the letters into spaces on the board to guess the word and solve the mystery of the #hashtag. \r\n\r\nCROSSWORDS\r\nTest your knowledge with this classic trivia word game, in both regular and mini versions! If you get stuck, use hints to save time and conquer the game like a pro!\r\n\r\n\r\nPASSWORD\r\nDo you have a way with words? Try this letter word game! You have 6 tries to guess the right word. Similar to Wordle. How many tries will it take? Test your skills and see the results!\r\n\r\n\r\nTANGLE: PUZZLE WITH LETTERS\r\nUnscramble the words in this mind-spinning challenge. Change one letter at a time until you solve the puzzle. Think you can you find the answer in the fewest moves?\r\n\r\n\r\nWORD SEARCH: THEMED\r\nFind the words by connecting the letters. Daily challenges feature themed puzzles, while unlimited mode features random word searches. Can you find them all?\r\n\r\n\r\nCONNECTED\r\nGroup words that have something in common!\r\nYou are given 16 words and need to create 4 groups of 4 words each. The groups must be composed of words that have something in common. You have 4 chances to succeed.\r\n\r\n\r\nCLADDER\r\nTime to flex those vocabulary muscles with Cladder! Start with a hint and change one letter at a time to get the word right. Stuck? No problem - you have two chances to jump and keep having fun!\r\n\r\nSUDOKU\r\nGive your brain a workout with this number puzzle. Place the numbers 1 to 9 in the grids and beat the challenge. It's all about logical reasoning and lots of fun while you play!\r\n\r\n\r\nSECRET WORD\r\nFind the secret word by guessing words that fit the puzzle theme. The alphabetical scale helps you make better guesses: they turn green when closest and orange when they're far from the secret word. Can you guess the secret word before you run out of guesses?\r\n\r\n\r\nMISSIONS\r\nTemporary and special events that enhance your achievements even more.\r\nComplete them to gain XP and earn special badges!\r\nPlay puzzles to earn XP and unlock mission achievements.\r\n\r\n\r\nXP LEVEL\r\nThe more you play, the more XP you earn. Complete daily challenges or finish missions to earn more XP.\r\nWith each new level, you earn more coins to continue having fun.\r\n\r\n\r\nBADGES\r\nComplete challenges and unlock achievements: Get rewarded for your skills with exclusive badges!\r\nCollect them to showcase your skills and mastery of Everyday Puzzles.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSOCIAL\r\nDon't play alone! \u200b\u200bLike your friends' achievements and earn coins!\r\nShare your achievements with your friends and see if you're the best.\r\n\r\n\r\nVIP\r\nBecome a subscriber to gain exclusive member perks\r\nPlay without ads and a chance to win more rewards!\r\n\r\n\r\nDAILY AND UNLIMITED PUZZLES\r\nPlay daily puzzles to win more XP!\r\nPlay puzzles in unlimited mode \r\nOr choose a date on the calendar to play past puzzles.\r\n\r\n\r\nDARK MODE\r\nDark mode available \r\nProtect your eyes and play comfortably at night or in the morning while in bed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEVERYDAY PUZZLES IS A FREE GAME AND PERFECT HOBBY!\r\nProduced by 5-star word game company Fanatee - creator of the free games CodyCross, Word Lanes, LunaCross, Stop and Stop 2!\r\n\r\nYou can read our privacy policy at https://fanatee.com/privacy-policy\r\nYou can read our terms of use at https://fanatee.com/terms-of-service",
    "descriptionHTML": "Everyday Puzzles - multiple games in one app!<br><br><br>A minigames hub with word games and puzzles.<br><br><br><br>Anygram, Hashtag, Crossword, Mini Crossword, Password, Tangle, Word Search, Cladder, Sudoku and Connected.<br><br><br>Play the newest minigame: SECRET WORD.<br><br>Play every day and keep your flame burning!<br>The FLAME represents your daily streak.<br>To light it, play Everyday Puzzles or unlimited mode.<br>Every day you play and maintain your streak, your flame increases one level of brightness.<br><br><br>CONSTANTLY UPDATED!<br><br>MANY GAMES IN ONE:<br><br>ANYGRAM<br>Unleash your anagram skills. Connect the letters to form as many words as possible and fill the board. It&#39;s like a word hunt in anagram form! Discover the hidden words and show off your vocabulary skills!<br><br><br>HASHTAG<br>Swipe and spell your way to victory! Drag and drop the letters into spaces on the board to guess the word and solve the mystery of the #hashtag. <br><br>CROSSWORDS<br>Test your knowledge with this classic trivia word game, in both regular and mini versions! If you get stuck, use hints to save time and conquer the game like a pro!<br><br><br>PASSWORD<br>Do you have a way with words? Try this letter word game! You have 6 tries to guess the right word. Similar to Wordle. How many tries will it take? Test your skills and see the results!<br><br><br>TANGLE: PUZZLE WITH LETTERS<br>Unscramble the words in this mind-spinning challenge. Change one letter at a time until you solve the puzzle. Think you can you find the answer in the fewest moves?<br><br><br>WORD SEARCH: THEMED<br>Find the words by connecting the letters. Daily challenges feature themed puzzles, while unlimited mode features random word searches. Can you find them all?<br><br><br>CONNECTED<br>Group words that have something in common!<br>You are given 16 words and need to create 4 groups of 4 words each. The groups must be composed of words that have something in common. You have 4 chances to succeed.<br><br><br>CLADDER<br>Time to flex those vocabulary muscles with Cladder! Start with a hint and change one letter at a time to get the word right. Stuck? No problem - you have two chances to jump and keep having fun!<br><br>SUDOKU<br>Give your brain a workout with this number puzzle. Place the numbers 1 to 9 in the grids and beat the challenge. It&#39;s all about logical reasoning and lots of fun while you play!<br><br><br>SECRET WORD<br>Find the secret word by guessing words that fit the puzzle theme. The alphabetical scale helps you make better guesses: they turn green when closest and orange when they&#39;re far from the secret word. Can you guess the secret word before you run out of guesses?<br><br><br>MISSIONS<br>Temporary and special events that enhance your achievements even more.<br>Complete them to gain XP and earn special badges!<br>Play puzzles to earn XP and unlock mission achievements.<br><br><br>XP LEVEL<br>The more you play, the more XP you earn. Complete daily challenges or finish missions to earn more XP.<br>With each new level, you earn more coins to continue having fun.<br><br><br>BADGES<br>Complete challenges and unlock achievements: Get rewarded for your skills with exclusive badges!<br>Collect them to showcase your skills and mastery of Everyday Puzzles.<br><br><br><br>SOCIAL<br>Don&#39;t play alone! \u200b\u200bLike your friends&#39; achievements and earn coins!<br>Share your achievements with your friends and see if you&#39;re the best.<br><br><br>VIP<br>Become a subscriber to gain exclusive member perks<br>Play without ads and a chance to win more rewards!<br><br><br>DAILY AND UNLIMITED PUZZLES<br>Play daily puzzles to win more XP!<br>Play puzzles in unlimited mode <br>Or choose a date on the calendar to play past puzzles.<br><br><br>DARK MODE<br>Dark mode available <br>Protect your eyes and play comfortably at night or in the morning while in bed.<br><br><br><br>EVERYDAY PUZZLES IS A FREE GAME AND PERFECT HOBBY!<br>Produced by 5-star word game company Fanatee - creator of the free games CodyCross, Word Lanes, LunaCross, Stop and Stop 2!<br><br>You can read our privacy policy at https://fanatee.com/privacy-policy<br>You can read our terms of use at https://fanatee.com/terms-of-service",
